    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾶ</span></b> , expld. by the Sch.<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ag.</u>
			1072
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			60.8
		</span></i> as 
			Dor.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾶ, γῆ,</span> in Trag. (lyr.)
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεῦ δᾶ,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
